---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---

<section class="intro">
  <h1>Spencer Delcore</h1>
  <p>
    Lead embedded developer at HMS Networks, where I build AI-driven embedded
    tooling — agents and hardware-in-the-loop CI/CD that flash, debug, and
    validate code on real hardware.
  </p>
  <p>
    I recently finished my MASc in Electrical and Computer Engineering at the
    University of Waterloo, researching autonomous-driving safety in the
    <a href="https://uwaterloo.ca/waterloo-intelligent-systems-engineering-lab/">WISE Lab</a>.
    Before that I spent six years at Molex leading embedded teams on
    safety-critical firmware.
  </p>
</section>

{% if collections.posts.length > 0 %}
<section class="recent-posts">
  <h2>Recent Posts</h2>
  <div class="blog-posts">
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse | limit(3) %}
      <article class="blog-post">
        <h3 class="blog-title">
          <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
        </h3>
        <div class="blog-meta">
          {{ post.date | dateDisplay }}
        </div>
        <div class="blog-excerpt">
          {% if post.data.description %}
            {{ post.data.description }}
          {% else %}
            {{ post.templateContent | excerpt }}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="read-more">Read more</a>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="view-all"><a href="/blog">View all posts</a></p>
</section>
{% endif %}

<style>
  .intro {
    padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .intro h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .intro p {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .intro a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .recent-posts h2 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .view-all {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .view-all a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
